# Liara deploy (explicit ask only)

**Never** deploy unless the user clearly asks (e.g. “deploy”, “ship to Liara”). Agent mode / commit / push do **not** imply deploy.

Production: Liara app **`inbox`**, domain **`inboxs.ir`**. Never Railway. Prefer GitHub Actions; local `liara deploy` only if Actions is unavailable (say so first).

**Staging:** app **`inbox-staging`**, URL **`https://inbox-staging.liara.run`**, workflow **`deploy-staging.yml`**. Separate DB (`inbox-staging-db`). See `docs/STAGING.md`. “Deploy staging” ≠ production deploy.

## Default path: germany-fast (locked for agents)

When the user says **deploy** / **ship** / **deploy all changes**, always use **`germany-fast`** unless they explicitly ask for Iran / “full” / “auto” / “safe path”.

| Input | Behavior | Typical wall time |
|---|---|---|
| **`germany-fast`** (default) | Skip Iran. Smoke/CI → Actions Nitro → Liara **Germany** → live verify | ~7–10 min |
| **`auto`** | Iran full-source first (12m CLI cap); Germany only if Iran fails | ~9–12 min healthy; ~20m if Iran hangs then falls back |
| **`iran-only`** | Full-source Iran only (recovery / “iran deploy”) | ~9–12 min |

Germany can still be healthy-but-502. **Live probe is mandatory.** If germany-fast (or Germany fallback) leaves production down, immediately run Iran recovery (`path=iran-only` or `liara-iran-deploy.yml`), re-probe, then dump.

Liara CLI `--build-location` only accepts **`iran`** | **`germany`**. Do not invent France.

## Hard lesson (Sep 2026)

Liara’s “Release created” / container health and a green Actions job can still leave **public 502**. Actions green ≠ site up. **Never tell the user deploy succeeded until a live probe passes.** If the app is dead after deploy, say clearly: **“Production is DOWN (502 / health failed).”** Do not soft-pedal.

Oct 2026: waiting on hung Iran before Germany made a deploy ~30m. That is why agent default is **germany-fast**, not Iran-first.

## When the user asks to deploy

1. Push deployable commits to GitHub `main` if ahead.
2. Prefer green CI for that SHA if still running; otherwise `deploy.yml` smoke gate covers it.
3. Trigger **germany-fast** and watch. Expect ~7–10 minutes. Do not use bare `deploy.yml` without `-f path=` (workflow default is germany-fast, but pass it explicitly).

```bash
gh workflow run deploy.yml --ref main -f path=germany-fast
gh run watch "$(gh run list --workflow=deploy.yml --limit 1 --json databaseId -q '.[0].databaseId')"
```

Only if the user asked for Iran / auto / full:

```bash
gh workflow run deploy.yml --ref main -f path=auto
# or:
gh workflow run deploy.yml --ref main -f path=iran-only
```

4. Confirm workflow success (**Deploy succeeded** + **Verify live inboxs.ir** must both be **green**, not skipped). Report Actions URL / SHA / path (`germany-fast` vs `auto` vs `iran-only`).
5. **Mandatory live probe** (even if the workflow already probed — agent double-check):

```bash
# Expect HTTP 200 and JSON ok:true / db:up. Retry ~2 min (15s interval) after release.
curl -sS -o /tmp/inbox-health -w '%{http_code}' --max-time 20 https://inboxs.ir/api/health
curl -sS -o /dev/null -w '%{http_code}' --max-time 20 https://inboxs.ir
curl -sS -o /dev/null -w '%{http_code}' --max-time 20 https://inbox.liara.run
```

   - **Pass:** health body has `"ok":true` (and preferably `"db":"up"`) and homepage is not 502.
   - **Fail (502 / 000 / non-ok):** tell the user **Production is DOWN**. Run Iran recovery (do not stop after one green Germany release):

```bash
gh workflow run deploy.yml --ref main -f path=iran-only
# or: gh workflow run liara-iran-deploy.yml --ref main
gh run watch "$(gh run list --workflow=deploy.yml --limit 1 --json databaseId -q '.[0].databaseId')"
# Re-run the live probe. Only then call the site up.
```

6. **Mandatory local DB dump** (Actions backup → download; local Liara CLI auth often broken):

```bash
gh workflow run backup-db.yml --ref main
# wait, then:
gh run download <BACKUP_RUN_ID> -n inbox-db-local-backup -D backups/tmp-dl
mv backups/tmp-dl/*.dump "backups/inbox-db-$(date +%Y%m%d-%H%M%S).dump"
rm -rf backups/tmp-dl
```

Report absolute dump path. Deploy is not done until dump exists **and** live probe passed.
7. If workflow, Iran retry, live probe, or backup fails after recovery attempts — **stop and tell the user**. Do not claim success.

Requires repo secret `LIARA_API_TOKEN`.

## Stuck Iran build (auto / iran-only only)

Sep 2026: a healthy Iran full-source job finishes in ~9 minutes. GitHub hides that step’s log until the job ends. `liara-deploy` uses `cancel-in-progress: false`, so a new production deploy waits behind a hung run.

If Iran is still `in_progress` **12 minutes after that job’s `started_at`** (matches the 12m CLI cap):

1. Force-cancel. A plain `gh run cancel` often does not kill a hung `liara deploy`.

```bash
gh api --method POST repos/ShushtarWolf/inbox/actions/runs/<RUN_ID>/force-cancel
```

2. Wait until that run is `completed` before starting another deploy.
3. Probe `https://inboxs.ir/api/health`. Cancelling an in-flight deploy leaves the previous release serving. Say production is down only if that probe fails.
4. Redeploy with **`germany-fast`** unless the user insisted on Iran. Do not raise Iran CLI timeout back to 20m/75m.
5. Do not sit on `gh run watch` until a hung Iran job ends — cancel at 12m and recover.

## Runtime image (Germany path)

`Dockerfile.runtime` (Debian slim) **must** `apt-get install openssl ca-certificates` before Prisma. Missing OpenSSL matched Liara Prisma warnings and dead containers. Do not remove that layer. Full-source `Dockerfile` already installs openssl on Alpine.

## What `deploy.yml` does

- Manual `workflow_dispatch` with `path` input (`germany-fast` | `auto` | `iran-only`); one deploy at a time (`cancel-in-progress: false`).
- CI green → skip smoke; else smoke gate.
- **germany-fast (default):** Actions-built Nitro → `Dockerfile.runtime` → Liara **Germany** (Iran skipped).
- **auto:** full-source `Dockerfile` → Liara **Iran** (12m cap); if that fails → Germany prebuilt.
- **iran-only:** Iran full-source only.
- **Verify live:** after a successful path, curl `https://inboxs.ir/api/health` until 200/`ok` or fail the workflow. Must not be skipped when a deploy path succeeded.
- If verify fails after Germany: agent runs `path=iran-only` (or `liara-iran-deploy.yml`) and re-probes.
- No GHCR/`--image`. No BuildKit `--mount` on Liara-built Dockerfiles.

Do not invent a path that skips Actions, smoke/CI, live probe, or the local dump.
